SUMMARY:Twin Dragons Grand Buffet/ White Squirrel Artisan Market (OPTIONAL
 )
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Twin Dragons Grand Buffet offers a
  really big buffet which is quite varied and all-you-can-eat. So come hung
 ry! 😋 There is also a sushi bar\, a hibachi grill and a dessert bar whi
 ch includes a you-scoop ice cream. 🍨 There** **is** **also American opt
 ions like pizza** **along with their traditional Chinese & Japanese dishes
 .**\n\n**NOTE: The restaurant offers gluten-free and also vegan options. T
 hey offer beer & wine\, too. 🍷 🍺**\n\n**COST: $14.95 for buffet**\n\
 n**MENU/WEBSITE: www.twindragonsgrandbuffet.shop/.**\n**www.twindragonsgra
 ndbuffet.twupro.com**\n\n************* **I had trouble with both of these 
 websites. Hopefully\, you will not!********\n\n**PARKING:** **Plenty of pa
 rking 🚙 🚗**\n\n**SOMETHING EXTRA YOU MIGHT WANT TO DO WHILE IN BREVA
 RD: This is strictly optional. Not a meetup\, but might be of interest to 
 you.**\n\n**The White Squirrel Artisans Market is being held from 12-5PM o
 n Saturday\, August 8. This is something you might want to attend prior to
  our meetup at 6:00 PM at Twin Dragons Grand Buffet. It’s a free event w
 ith 65 local artisans\, food & drink\, and live music.**\n\n**LOCATION: Th
 e Porter Center on the campus of Brevard College downtown Brevard. 1 Breva
 rd College Dr.\, Brevard\, N.C. 28712.**\n\n**You might want to also check
  out downtown Brevard. There are quite a few quaint shops like the White S
 quirrel Shoppe\, clothing & gift shops\, and two chocolate (Yum! 😋) sho
 ps.**\n\n**NOTE: By the way\, the Porter Center at Brevard College is only
  2.1 miles from Twin Dragons Grand Buffet.**\n\n**See you at Twin Dragons 
 Grand Buffet!**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(8
 28)699-8180 (call or text)**
