SUMMARY:The Emporium Market & The Tea Cottage ~ (Men are welcome\, too!) 
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**I thought it would be nice to have
  some afternoon tea in The Tea Cottage that’s tucked away in the back of
  the Emporium Market on N. Main St. and then browse around the emporium af
 terwards. Want to join me?**\n\n**THE TEA COTTAGE:** **The Tea Cottage is 
 located in the back of the emporium. It’s a small & cozy place with only
  four tables so I can only have a max of 16 people.**\n\n**COST:** **$15 p
 er person which includes a pot of tea\, a scone w/jam\, and assorted fruit
 s. You may also order à la carte. If you don’t prefer tea you may also 
 order ice tea\, lattes\, or French pressed coffee instead.**\n\n**MENU:** 
 **www.carolinaepicurean.com**\n**I also put the menu in the photo section 
 below although you most likely will need a magnifying glass to read it!**\
 n\n**THE EMPORIUM MARKET:** **There are over a 100 vendors selling jewelry
 \, artwork\, wood items\, candles\, soap\, etc. It will be fun to browse a
 round after we have our tea.**\n**www.theemporiumonmain.com.**\n\n**PHOTOS
 :** **View the photos in photo section below.**\n\n**RESERVATIONS:** **We 
 have reservations at 1:00 for tea. Friday\, August 14.**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CO
 NCERNS?**\n**Shae.Kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (Call or text)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31578049
