SUMMARY:Boodas Brewing Co. Dinner/Trivia Night (Optional) 🍻
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Boodas Brewing Co. is a brewpub lo
 cated in downtown Hendersonville. Connie suggested this for a meetup which
  I thought was a great idea! Thanks\, Connie! She will also be co-hosting.
  The food is supposed to be really good plus they have Trivia Night on Thu
 rsday nights. Fun! 🤩**\n\n**DRINKS:** **Boodas Brewery has 24 taps and 
 craft beer. They also offer non-alcoholic beers and mocktails. 🍻🍹**\
 n**Would you rather have wine? 🍷 No problem! They offer a variety of re
 d & white wine. Champagne 🍾 and prosecco is offered\, too! Check out** 
 **their** **drink menu online.**\n\n**MENU/WEBSITE: They have a full kitch
 en and taproom. To view their menu (quite a selection) go to: www.boodasbr
 ewingcompany.com. They offer vegan options on their menu. By the way\, on 
 Trivia nights there are food & drink specials.**\n\n**PET-FRIENDLY:** **Pe
 ts are allowed on their outside patio area.**\n\n**PARKING:** **Boodas has
  their own free off-street parking area. There is also free street parking
  nearby.**\n\n**We will meetup at 5:30 PM to eat & socialize.**\n**For tho
 se who wish to play Trivia that starts at 7:00 PM. If you wish not to play
  trivia just relax and cheer the others on!**\n\n**TRIVIA NIGHT (Optional)
 :** **Every Thursday night is Trivia Night at Boodas Brewery Co. It starts
  at 7:00 PM. It’s** **FREE** **to play. It’s hosted by Another Round T
 rivia and consists of 6 rounds of questions. There are prizes for winning 
 teams.**\n\n**Come join me & Connie for good food & drink ~~ and to play T
 rivia if you want! 🍻🤩**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@a
 ol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (Text or call) - I prefer text since I work\, bu
 t I will return your call when I can.**
