SUMMARY:Neil Simon’s THE ODD COUPLE - Flat Rock Playhouse 🎭 \n\n(RSVP
  NOW CLOSED)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Neil Simon’s THE ODD COUPLE shou
 ld be a fun play to go see! It’s a classic comedic play about two recent
 ly divorced friends who become roommates. Oscar is a fun-loving slob and F
 elix is** **an** **obsessive-compulsive neat freak. I’m sure we will be 
 laughing a lot! If y’all ever used to watch The Odd Couple on TV years a
 go then you have** **an** **idea what a fun play this should be! It was on
  TV for 5 seasons. There was also the movie. So come laugh with me 😂 an
 d let’s all have a fun afternoon! By the way\, a big thanks to Dawn for 
 suggesting we go see a live play. You got it\, Dawn! 😃**\n\n**TICKETS: 
 (non-refundable).**\n**Tickets run from $50 to $73.**\n**Level 1 - $73**\n
 **Level 2 - $63**\n**Level 3 - $50**\n**Please go to the website to view t
 he seating chart.**\n**Dawn and I decided to splurge on level 1\, and we w
 ill be on row F on the right side. The first two seats next to the aisle i
 f you would like to sit near us. But\, of course\, you may sit anywhere yo
 u wish.**\n**NOTE: Remember that we are going on Saturday\, August 29 at t
 he 2:00 PM performance when you purchase your tickets.**\n\n**WEBSITE & PH
 ONE #:**\n**Flatrockplayhouse.org.**\n**(828)693-0731**\n**You might want 
 to call to get more information about seating. That’s what I did\, and t
 he lady was very helpful.**\n\n**LENGTH OF PLAY: 2 hours with a 15 minute 
 intermission.**\n\n**PARKING: Plenty of parking available.**\n\n**WHERE TO
  MEET:**\n**Since we all may be sitting on different levels we will meet i
 n front of the playhouse prior to the performance. I’ll be there around 
 1:30.**\n\n**A BITE TO EAT AFTER THE PLAY:**\n**We will have reservations 
 (limited) at Campfire Grill just down the road. Please RSVP to each meetup
  separately.**\n\n**IMPORTANT: if you want to get a good seat I suggest yo
 u get your tickets soon. Even though the performance isn’t until late Au
 gust the seats fill up fast!**\n\n**I hope you will come and spend a fun a
 fternoon with me! 🎭**\n\n**Questions?**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(8
 28)699-8180 (call or text. I prefer text for I work\, but I will return yo
 ur call).**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/seniorsinglesfunbunch/events/31480936
