SUMMARY:Campfire Grill ~ (Meetup only for those attending the Odd Couple P
 lay)
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**NOTE: Due to Campfire Grill’s li
 mited reservation policy (especially on a Saturday) I had to limit this me
 etup to only those members & their guests attending the play at the Flat R
 ock Theatre.**\n\n**Campfire Grill is a farm-to-table American restaurant 
 in Flat Rock known for its nostalgic summer camp theme and their mission t
 o support local camps.**\n**Campfire Grill offers indoor and outdoor seati
 ng. They also have a full bar. 🍹🍷🍺**\n\n**MENU: To view the menu 
 please go to: campfiregrillnc.com.**\n\n**LOCATION: The grill is only 0.4 
 miles from the Flat Rock Playhouse. You can just walk to it if you wish! B
 eats trying to find a parking place!**\n**The Campfire Grill is located on
  Little Rainbow Row 🌈 and is connected to Hubba Hubba Smokehouse.**\n\n
 **PARKING: 🅿️ Parking can be a hassle in just trying to find a place!
  That’s why I left some time from when the play is over to our reservati
 on time at the restaurant. 4:30 PM.**\n\n**Hope you will join me! 😃**\n
 \n**QUESTIONS?**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com**\n**(828)699- 8180 (Text or call
 . I prefer text for I work\, but will return your call)**
