SUMMARY:Labor Day Lunch ~ Goodbye to Summer! 🌞 👋
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n**Dawn suggested (suggestions are al
 ways welcomed from anyone!) we go to Papas & Beer 🍺 in Hendersonville f
 or some good Mexican food. Sounded good to me! And to celebrate closing ou
 t the summer why not on Labor Day weekend? So I made this meetup for a Lab
 or Day lunch.** **So come on out!**\n\n**LOCATION:** **This is the Papas &
  Beer in Hendersonville (close to Bay Breeze Seafood Restaurant) ~ not the
  Asheville location.**\n\n************NOTE:** **Papas & Beer does not take
  reservations so please be patient if we have to wait about 10 minutes or 
 so to be seated.**\n\n**WEBSITE/MENU:** **Check out their lunch menu at ww
 w.papasandbeerhendo.com. By the way\, they do offer vegan\, vegetarian\, a
 nd gluten-free options. They also have a full liquor bar and also a salsa 
 bar.** **😋**\n\n**PARKING:** **If you can’t get a parking place in th
 e front there is parking in the rear of the restaurant.** **🚗**\n\n**PE
 T FRIENDLY: Leashed\, well-behaved dogs are allowed on their enclosed outd
 oor area.** **🐶🐾**\n\n**Hope you will join me at Papas & Beer! 🍺 
 Happy Labor Day! 🌞**\n\n**QUESTIONS/CONCERNS:**\n**Shae.kemerer@aol.com
 **\n**(828)699-8180 (Call or text)**
