SUMMARY:Fork & Plough Restaurant (Meetup after the Greenville Zoo) - Green
 ville\, S.C.
DESCRIPTION:Senior Singles Fun Bunch\n*** This meetup is open to all our m
 embers whether you go to the zoo or not.**\n\n**The Fork & Plough will be 
 the idea place to eat after our zoo excursion. It’s a farm-to-table rest
 aurant\, market\, and butcher shop. It’s only 1.8 miles from the zoo ~ a
  6-minute drive. It offers a rustic chic atmosphere. They have a varied se
 asonal menu that changes daily. They also have a full bar for those who de
 sire an alcoholic drink. 🍹 They also offer vegetarian\, vegan\, and glu
 ten-free options.**\n\n**MENU: Please go to: www.forkandplough.com**\n\n**
 PARKING: 🅿️** **Available directly behind the restaurant. If lot is f
 ull then free parking is available right down the street at Overbrook Bapt
 ist Church.**\n\n**NO PETS:** **🐶 Only service dogs are allowed inside 
 restaurant.**\n\n**RESERVATIONS: We will have reservations for 12:30 PM.**
 \n\n**I hope you will join me!**\n\n**Questions/Concerns?**\n**Shae.kemere
 r@aol.com**\n**(828)699-8180 (call or text)**
